# source media kept locally, never shipped: screen recordings and the
# full-size originals of screenshots that are committed resized. the .mov
# sources are ~54MB and their exported .mp4 is already tracked, and the
# "* - Services.png" originals duplicate the 1600px services-*.png files.
public/*.mov
public/* - [Ss]ervices.png
public/dci-form-inputs.png

# the design-system showcase is a separate Vite/React project that happens to
# live here. it is a SOURCE reference for the Design system section, not a
# site asset - and anything under public/ is served verbatim, so committing
# it would publish 9MB of someone else's build config at a guessable URL.
public/Design System Showcase Page/
